[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32_desc]
Muffin Festival!\nSince the publication of “Muffinology”, countless ordinary ponies outside Muffin Heaven have also become enthusiastic about making muffins. Countless scholars and chefs are studying the methods of making muffins and how to make muffins more delicious.\nNowadays, various advanced technologies about muffins have been invented, and the types of muffins are increasing. The Muffin Festival is a festival held to celebrate the deliciousness of muffins.\nIn this festival, ponies will share their muffins with each other, taste other ponies’ muffins, and hold muffin making competitions. The Muffin Festival is a very lively and delicious festival.\nThe most important part of the Muffin Festival is that all the muffin believers in the world will make muffins and pour them all in front of the statue of Saint Derpy Hooves in the center of Cloudsdale, forming a huge muffin mountain. This muffin mountain will be distributed to all the ponies who participate in the festival after the festival ends, so that they can take them home to share.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
Give 50 §YGenerous Aids§! ([?ROOT.VAR_MUFFINS_AID_TOTAL_C03|Y0]/50)

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32_desc]
马芬狂欢节！\n自从《马芬学讲座》出版后，马芬天国之外的无数普通小马也开始热衷于制作马芬。无数的学者和厨师们都在研究马芬的制作方法，以及如何让马芬更加美味。\n如今，关于马芬的各种各样的先进科技都已经被发明出来，马芬的种类也越来越多。马芬狂欢节就是为了庆祝马芬的美味而举办的节日。\n在这个节日里，小马们会互相分享自己的马芬，品尝别人的马芬，还会举办马芬制作大赛。马芬狂欢节是一个非常热闹的节日，也是一个非常美味的节日。\n马芬狂欢节最重要的组成部分，便是全世界的马芬信徒们会制作马芬，将它们全都倒在云中城市中心圣呆蹄雕像前，形成一个巨大的马芬山。这座马芬山会在节日结束后被分发给所有参加节日的小马们，让他们带回家中分享。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_32_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
进行50次§Y慷慨的援助§! ([?ROOT.VAR_MUFFINS_AID_TOTAL_C03|Y0]/50)

